  unitName: Rumbling Blade Balgran
  unitId: 40587
  unitNumber: 1720
  description: Balgran concealed his heritage and devoted his life to protecting
    his younger sister, the Oracle Maiden. Even so, it seems certain that he simply
    wished to live alongside her. Had Balgran only united with the Oracle Knight's
    party sooner, he likely would have had a chance to inform Ilia of their relationship.
    He also would have certainly won the confidence of the Oracle Knight's companions
    over the long-awaited journey with his sister. Trusting his dear sister and his
    own safety to these allies, Balgran would have led the charge, his blade free
    of doubts and concerns.
  summonDesc: My heart had frozen over.<br>I was convinced that I was the only one
    who could keep my sister safe.
  fusionDesc: Relationships are funny things. Even though we didn't get much time
    together, our hearts are as one.
  evoDesc: They're my family.<br>We're all going to make it home alive. I'll make
    sure of that.
  element: 4
  rarity: 7
